    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.poster.avif?t=1739398630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.webm?t=1739398630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.mp4?t=1739398630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore the dark hallways of underground parking and find a passage to the hidden obscure underworld. Find new weapons and use them to survive. Solve the mystery of this cursed place and the monsters that inhabit it. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/91f74e1b70e9bafdc70c9781bbd1a4c2.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><li>Every weapon has its dedicated use in a battle against the mutants, the undead, and the military;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/4327c65f4bf4b1460567d00c9f792ed9.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Unique gameplay combines survival, ammo management, shoot\u2019em\u2019up, and racing;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8be294135af7ecc5fe1f60856336938f.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Inspired by Splatterpunk storytelling style;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/81f675425f34ba65fc7a7da7a9d77798.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Levels filled with secrets and challenges.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.poster.avif?t=1739398630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.webm?t=1739398630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8538b7da950ce8aa67ab982a009dde5f.mp4?t=1739398630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore the dark hallways of underground parking and find a passage to the hidden obscure underworld. Find new weapons and use them to survive. Solve the mystery of this cursed place and the monsters that inhabit it. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/91f74e1b70e9bafdc70c9781bbd1a4c2.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><li>Every weapon has its dedicated use in a battle against the mutants, the undead, and the military;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/4327c65f4bf4b1460567d00c9f792ed9.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Unique gameplay combines survival, ammo management, shoot\u2019em\u2019up, and racing;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/8be294135af7ecc5fe1f60856336938f.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Inspired by Splatterpunk storytelling style;<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/878580/extras/81f675425f34ba65fc7a7da7a9d77798.avif?t=1739398630\" /></div><br></li><li>Levels filled with secrets and challenges.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Drug dealer Butch slays hordes of living dead to save a girl. Garage is a bloody topdown shooter inspired by VHS era B-movies.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cNot meant to be a quick spray and pray shooter, the variety in the challenges you\u2019ll face, the line of sight mechanic, and the plain old weirdness throughout make it worthwhile if you\u2019re up for the challenge.\u201d<br>85/100 \u2013 Nindie Spotlight<br><br>\u201cIt is wonderfully well made with beautiful pixel art, a fantastic soundtrack and great sound effects. Garage is gory and fun as hell and i love it.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 The Switch Effect<br><br>\u201cIf you\u2019ve been jonesing for something that brings demented television, rat-burping corpses, an oddly placed motorcycle mini game and two-headed dogs all in the same, you\u2019ve definitely come to the right place.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Bonus Stage<br>",
